  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://iocl.com/apprenticeships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Indian Oil Corporation Limited (IOCL)</a> </span>has released the notification for the post of Apprentice. This recruitment has been issued for 838 posts. Online applying process for IOCL Apprentice Recruitment 2025 has started from 24 January 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till 14 February 2025. Candidates must check the complete details for IOCL Apprentice Recruitment 2025 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indian Oil Corporation Limited (IOCL)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IOCL Apprentice Recruitment 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 January 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date (NR Region) : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>13 February 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date (ER Region) : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>14 February 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>No Application Fees For Any Candidates</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 31 January 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>24 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per IOCL Apprentice Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 838 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Apprentice NR</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">456</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Apprentice ER</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">382</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>IOCL Apprentice Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> Candidates must have passed Degree in Related Trade&nbsp;from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice Online Form 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://iocl.com/apprenticeships or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the IOCL before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for IOCL Apprentice recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IOCL Apprentice Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Merit List</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online NR Region</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.apprenticeshipindia.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Trade</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> |</span> <a href=\"https://nats.education.gov.in/student_register.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Technician/Graduate</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online ER Region</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.apprenticeshipindia.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Trade</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> |</span> <a href=\"https://nats.education.gov.in/student_register.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Technician/Graduate</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><b><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IOCL-NR-Apprentice-Recruitment-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NR</a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> |</span> <a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/IOCL-ER-Apprentice-Recruitment-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ER</a></b></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; p